WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:03,710
Dirty, need to be washed

2
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:05,710
Okay, I'll go back and take a shower right away

3
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:10,260
Guest, do you need to bring the fruit you asked me to leave this morning?

4
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:11,260
bring it

5
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:14,260
Bear, bring the fruits ordered by customer 301

6
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:18,460
Is it the kind of fruit I think of?

7
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:21,460
There is actually fresh fruit in Mosaic

8
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:24,460
Can I eat iced watermelon?

9
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:26,460
This pink, seedless flesh has a cool texture

10
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:29,460
Take a bite and your mouth will be filled with juice.

11
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:31,460
These are three new fruits launched by the store

12
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:33,460
If guests need it, they can buy a few to try.

13
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,460
Only three levels of points each

14
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:38,560
Try it first, it tastes good before buying it

15
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:40,560
I have to work hard and like the gold box more

16
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:42,780
Bear, send it to 201

17
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:44,780
Do you think you can stop spending money upstairs?

18
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:45,780
Beautiful thought

19
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:46,780
Good match for the host

20
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:48,820
Boss Xia is full of love

21
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:50,820
What a rare good person in this world.
